# badarity.poke -- a hello one byte short.
#
# The dispatcher checks the length against the op table BEFORE the handler
# runs, so this never reaches op_ctl_hello. Strict arity is the anti desync
# mechanism: the realistic catastrophic failure of this protocol is not a
# deadlock but a program that under reads a reply and shifts every frame
# after it, and an exact length turns that into a loud failure within a
# frame or two.
EMIT 01 09 00 42 53 54 4d 01 00 00 00 00
READ 3
